{"seq":1,"slug":"ebpf-kubernetes","title":"eBPF 在 Kubernetes 中的部署","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/ebpf-observability/production/ebpf-kubernetes","wordCount":1271,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"ebpf-在-kubernetes-中的部署\">eBPF 在 Kubernetes 中的部署</h1><p>在 Kubernetes 环境中部署 eBPF 程序面临一系列特有挑战：容器运行时的权限隔离、内核版本碎片化、cgroup 层级关联、Pod 生命周期管理。本篇从部署模型选择到具体的 RBAC 配置、从内核版本兼容性到 Pod 身份关联，提供完整的生产部署指南。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Kubernetes 部署 eBPF 的难点不在 eBPF 本身，而在容器环境带来的三重错位：权限上，内核级程序需要特权能力，而集群默认最小权限；版本上，滚动升级与混合节点池让内核版本碎片化；语义上，内核看到的是 PID/cgroup/netns，而 Kubernetes 的概念是 Pod/Service/Namespace。因此生产部署的设计要点是：用 DaemonSet + 精确 capabilities 替代 privileged，用启动时特性探测实现优雅降级，用 cgroup ID 或 netns cookie 建立内核到 Pod 的身份映射。</p>\n<h2 id=\"部署模型选择\">部署模型选择</h2><p>eBPF 程序在 Kubernetes 中有三种主要部署模式，每种适用于不同场景：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A{部署需求} --&gt; B[DaemonSet 模式]&#10;    A --&gt; C[Sidecar 模式]&#10;    A --&gt; D[Operator 模式]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[每节点一个 Agent&lt;br/&gt;共享内核视角]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[每 Pod 一个容器&lt;br/&gt;应用级观测]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[集中管理 + 节点执行&lt;br/&gt;声明式 CRD]&#10;    B1 --&gt; E[推荐: Cilium, Pixie, Parca]&#10;    C1 --&gt; F[极少使用: 违背 eBPF 优势]&#10;    D1 --&gt; G[推荐: Tetragon, bpfman]\">flowchart TD\n    A{部署需求} --&gt; B[DaemonSet 模式]\n    A --&gt; C[Sidecar 模式]\n    A --&gt; D[Operator 模式]\n    B --&gt; B1[每节点一个 Agent&lt;br/&gt;共享内核视角]\n    C --&gt; C1[每 Pod 一个容器&lt;br/&gt;应用级观测]\n    D --&gt; D1[集中管理 + 节点执行&lt;br/&gt;声明式 CRD]\n    B1 --&gt; E[推荐: Cilium, Pixie, Parca]\n    C1 --&gt; F[极少使用: 违背 eBPF 优势]\n    D1 --&gt; G[推荐: Tetragon, bpfman]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>劣势</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>DaemonSet</td>\n<td>资源与 Pod 数解耦；统一的节点视角</td>\n<td>需要特权容器</td>\n<td>网络/系统级可观测性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Operator + CRD</td>\n<td>声明式策略管理；按需加载程序</td>\n<td>架构复杂度</td>\n<td>安全策略、动态追踪</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>嵌入应用镜像</td>\n<td>应用隔离</td>\n<td>每个应用重复、违背 eBPF 架构</td>\n<td>极特殊场景</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"daemonset-配置要点\">DaemonSet 配置要点</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"apiVersion: apps/v1&#10;kind: DaemonSet&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: ebpf-agent&#10;  namespace: monitoring&#10;spec:&#10;  selector:&#10;    matchLabels:&#10;      app: ebpf-agent&#10;  template:&#10;    spec:&#10;      hostPID: true # 看到宿主机进程&#10;      hostNetwork: true # 看到宿主机网络&#10;      containers:&#10;        - name: agent&#10;          image: my-ebpf-agent:v1.0&#10;          securityContext:&#10;            privileged: false # 避免 privileged&#10;            capabilities:&#10;              add:&#10;                - BPF # 加载 eBPF 程序&#10;                - PERFMON # perf_event 访问&#10;                - NET_ADMIN # 网络 hook&#10;                - SYS_RESOURCE # RLIMIT_MEMLOCK&#10;          volumeMounts:&#10;            - name: bpf-fs&#10;              mountPath: /sys/fs/bpf&#10;            - name: debugfs&#10;              mountPath: /sys/kernel/debug&#10;              readOnly: true&#10;            - name: btf&#10;              mountPath: /sys/kernel/btf&#10;              readOnly: true&#10;      volumes:&#10;        - name: bpf-fs&#10;          hostPath:&#10;            path: /sys/fs/bpf&#10;            type: DirectoryOrCreate&#10;        - name: debugfs&#10;          hostPath:&#10;            path: /sys/kernel/debug&#10;        - name: btf&#10;          hostPath:&#10;            path: /sys/kernel/btf\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">apps/v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">DaemonSet</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ebpf-agent</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  namespace</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">monitoring</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  selector</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    matchLabels</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      app</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ebpf-agent</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  template</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      hostPID</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 看到宿主机进程</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      hostNetwork</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 看到宿主机网络</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      containers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">agent</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          image</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">my-ebpf-agent:v1.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          securityContext</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            privileged</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 避免 privileged</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            capabilities</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">              add</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">BPF</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 加载 eBPF 程序</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">PERFMON</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # perf_event 访问</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">NET_ADMIN</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 网络 hook</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SYS_RESOURCE</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # RLIMIT_MEMLOCK</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          volumeMounts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">bpf-fs</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">              mountPath</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/sys/fs/bpf</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">debugfs</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">              mountPath</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/sys/kernel/debug</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">              readOnly</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">btf</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">              mountPath</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/sys/kernel/btf</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">              readOnly</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      volumes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">bpf-fs</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          hostPath</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/sys/fs/bpf</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">DirectoryOrCreate</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">debugfs</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          hostPath</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/sys/kernel/debug</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">btf</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          hostPath</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/sys/kernel/btf</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"权限与安全\">权限与安全</h2><h3 id=\"linux-capabilities-最小集\">Linux Capabilities 最小集</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Capability</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>何时需要</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>CAP_BPF</code></td>\n<td>加载 eBPF 程序和创建 map</td>\n<td>始终需要</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>CAP_PERFMON</code></td>\n<td>访问 perf_event 和 tracepoint</td>\n<td>CPU profiling</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>CAP_NET_ADMIN</code></td>\n<td>挂载 XDP/tc 程序</td>\n<td>网络可观测性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>CAP_SYS_PTRACE</code></td>\n<td>读取其他进程的内存</td>\n<td>uprobe</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>CAP_SYS_RESOURCE</code></td>\n<td>提升 RLIMIT_MEMLOCK</td>\n<td>大型 map（5.11 前）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>CAP_SYS_ADMIN</code></td>\n<td>全能后备（不推荐）</td>\n<td>仅在上述组合不够时</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>生产建议</strong>：避免 <code>privileged: true</code>，按实际需要组合 capabilities。Linux 5.8+ 的 <code>CAP_BPF</code> + <code>CAP_PERFMON</code> 覆盖大多数可观测性场景。</p>\n<h3 id=\"pod-security-standards-兼容性\">Pod Security Standards 兼容性</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# Pod Security Admission 配置&#10;apiVersion: policy/v1&#10;kind: PodSecurityPolicy # 或 Pod Security Standards label&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: ebpf-agent-psp&#10;spec:&#10;  privileged: false&#10;  allowedCapabilities:&#10;    - BPF&#10;    - PERFMON&#10;    - NET_ADMIN&#10;  hostPID: true&#10;  hostNetwork: true&#10;  volumes:&#10;    - hostPath&#10;    - configMap&#10;    - secret&#10;  allowedHostPaths:&#10;    - pathPrefix: /sys/fs/bpf&#10;    - pathPrefix: /sys/kernel/btf&#10;      readOnly: true&#10;    - pathPrefix: /sys/kernel/debug&#10;      readOnly: true\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Pod Security Admission 配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">policy/v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">PodSecurityPolicy</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 或 Pod Security Standards label</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ebpf-agent-psp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  privileged</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  allowedCapabilities</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">BPF</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">PERFMON</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">NET_ADMIN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  hostPID</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  hostNetwork</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  volumes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">hostPath</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">configMap</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">secret</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  allowedHostPaths</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">pathPrefix</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/sys/fs/bpf</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">pathPrefix</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/sys/kernel/btf</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      readOnly</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">pathPrefix</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/sys/kernel/debug</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      readOnly</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"内核版本兼容性\">内核版本兼容性</h2><p>Kubernetes 集群通常包含不同内核版本的节点（滚动升级、混合节点池）。eBPF agent 必须处理这种异构性。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>内核版本</th>\n<th>可用能力</th>\n<th>重要特性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>4.14+</td>\n<td>kprobe, tracepoint, XDP</td>\n<td>基础追踪和网络</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4.18+</td>\n<td>BTF 支持开始</td>\n<td>BCC libbpf-tools</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5.2+</td>\n<td>BTF 内置到内核</td>\n<td>CO-RE 可移植性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5.5+</td>\n<td>fentry/fexit</td>\n<td>高性能函数追踪</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5.7+</td>\n<td>BPF LSM</td>\n<td>安全策略执行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5.8+</td>\n<td>Ring Buffer, CAP_BPF</td>\n<td>现代事件传输</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5.10+</td>\n<td>task_local_storage</td>\n<td>高效进程关联</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5.15+</td>\n<td>bpf_timer</td>\n<td>定时器和超时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6.0+</td>\n<td>改进的 kfunc</td>\n<td>扩展内核函数调用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6.9+</td>\n<td>BPF token</td>\n<td>受限环境加载</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[Agent 启动] --&gt; B[检测内核版本]&#10;    B --&gt; C{版本 &gt;= 5.8?}&#10;    C --&gt;|是| D[完整功能模式]&#10;    C --&gt;|否| E{版本 &gt;= 5.2?}&#10;    E --&gt;|是| F[CO-RE 模式&lt;br/&gt;无 Ring Buffer]&#10;    E --&gt;|否| G{版本 &gt;= 4.14?}&#10;    G --&gt;|是| H[降级模式&lt;br/&gt;仅基础 kprobe]&#10;    G --&gt;|否| I[不支持&lt;br/&gt;跳过此节点]&#10;    D --&gt; J[加载完整程序集]&#10;    F --&gt; K[使用 perf_event_array]&#10;    H --&gt; L[加载兼容程序子集]\">flowchart TD\n    A[Agent 启动] --&gt; B[检测内核版本]\n    B --&gt; C{版本 &gt;= 5.8?}\n    C --&gt;|是| D[完整功能模式]\n    C --&gt;|否| E{版本 &gt;= 5.2?}\n    E --&gt;|是| F[CO-RE 模式&lt;br/&gt;无 Ring Buffer]\n    E --&gt;|否| G{版本 &gt;= 4.14?}\n    G --&gt;|是| H[降级模式&lt;br/&gt;仅基础 kprobe]\n    G --&gt;|否| I[不支持&lt;br/&gt;跳过此节点]\n    D --&gt; J[加载完整程序集]\n    F --&gt; K[使用 perf_event_array]\n    H --&gt; L[加载兼容程序子集]</pre><h2 id=\"pod-身份关联\">Pod 身份关联</h2><p>eBPF 程序运行在内核态，看到的是 PID、cgroup ID、网络命名空间等内核概念；而 Kubernetes 的概念是 Pod、Service、Namespace。关联二者需要额外的映射机制。</p>\n<h3 id=\"cgroup-id-方案-推荐\">cgroup ID 方案（推荐）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"// 内核态：获取 cgroup ID&#10;u64 cgroup_id = bpf_get_current_cgroup_id();&#10;&#10;// 用户态：建立 cgroup_id -&gt; Pod 映射&#10;// 通过 /sys/fs/cgroup/kubepods/.../cgroup.procs 或 CRI API\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 内核态：获取 cgroup ID</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">u64 cgroup_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> bpf_get_current_cgroup_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 用户态：建立 cgroup_id -> Pod 映射</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 通过 /sys/fs/cgroup/kubepods/.../cgroup.procs 或 CRI API</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"网络命名空间方案\">网络命名空间方案</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"// 通过 socket 的网络命名空间 cookie 标识 Pod&#10;u64 netns_cookie = bpf_get_netns_cookie(ctx);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 通过 socket 的网络命名空间 cookie 标识 Pod</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">u64 netns_cookie </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> bpf_get_netns_cookie</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx);</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"映射维护\">映射维护</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>数据源</th>\n<th>更新延迟</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>cgroup ID</td>\n<td>/proc/PID/cgroup</td>\n<td>实时</td>\n<td>进程级追踪</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>netns cookie</td>\n<td>内核 socket</td>\n<td>实时</td>\n<td>网络流量关联</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Kubernetes API watch</td>\n<td>API Server</td>\n<td>秒级</td>\n<td>Pod metadata enrichment</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CRI (containerd/crio)</td>\n<td>Unix socket</td>\n<td>百毫秒</td>\n<td>容器创建时关联</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"节点特性检测与优雅降级\">节点特性检测与优雅降级</h2><p>生产级 eBPF agent 必须处理异构集群中的能力差异：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"// Agent 启动时的特性探测&#10;struct node_features {&#10;    bool has_btf;           // /sys/kernel/btf/vmlinux 存在&#10;    bool has_ringbuf;       // 尝试创建 RINGBUF map&#10;    bool has_fentry;        // 尝试加载 fentry 程序&#10;    bool has_bpf_lsm;      // LSM hook 可用&#10;    bool has_bpf_timer;     // bpf_timer 可用&#10;    u32  max_entries;       // map 大小限制&#10;    u32  kernel_version;    // 主版本号&#10;};&#10;&#10;// 根据探测结果选择程序集&#10;void load_programs(struct node_features *feat) {&#10;    if (feat-&gt;has_fentry) {&#10;        load_fentry_programs();&#10;    } else {&#10;        load_kprobe_fallback();&#10;    }&#10;    if (feat-&gt;has_ringbuf) {&#10;        create_ringbuf_maps();&#10;    } else {&#10;        create_perf_event_maps();&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Agent 启动时的特性探测</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> node_features {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    bool</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> has_btf;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">           // /sys/kernel/btf/vmlinux 存在</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    bool</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> has_ringbuf;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">       // 尝试创建 RINGBUF map</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    bool</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> has_fentry;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 尝试加载 fentry 程序</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    bool</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> has_bpf_lsm;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      // LSM hook 可用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    bool</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> has_bpf_timer;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">     // bpf_timer 可用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    u32  max_entries;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">       // map 大小限制</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    u32  kernel_version;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 主版本号</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 根据探测结果选择程序集</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> load_programs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> node_features </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">feat</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (feat->has_fentry) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        load_fentry_programs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        load_kprobe_fallback</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (feat->has_ringbuf) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        create_ringbuf_maps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        create_perf_event_maps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"升级与滚动更新\">升级与滚动更新</h2><p>eBPF 程序的升级需要特别注意——旧程序卸载和新程序加载之间的间隙可能导致观测数据丢失或网络中断。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>升级策略</th>\n<th>数据连续性</th>\n<th>风险</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>原子替换</td>\n<td>无间隙</td>\n<td>新程序 verifier 失败则回滚</td>\n<td>生产首选</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pin + 替换</td>\n<td>短暂间隙</td>\n<td>Map 数据保留，程序切换</td>\n<td>Map 状态重要时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>节点 cordon/drain</td>\n<td>完整隔离</td>\n<td>需要多余节点容量</td>\n<td>大版本升级</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 原子替换示例（bpf_link_update）&#10;# 1. 加载新程序到内核&#10;new_prog_fd=$(bpftool prog load new.bpf.o /sys/fs/bpf/new)&#10;# 2. 原子更新已有 link&#10;bpftool link update id $LINK_ID prog id $new_prog_fd&#10;# 3. 卸载旧程序&#10;bpftool prog pin id $old_prog_fd  # 取消 pin\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 原子替换示例（bpf_link_update）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 1. 加载新程序到内核</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">new_prog_fd</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">bpftool</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> prog</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> load</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> new.bpf.o</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /sys/fs/bpf/new</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 2. 原子更新已有 link</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">bpftool</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> link</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> update</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $LINK_ID </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">prog</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $new_prog_fd</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 3. 卸载旧程序</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">bpftool</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> prog</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> pin</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $old_prog_fd  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 取消 pin</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"多租户隔离\">多租户隔离</h2><p>在共享集群中，eBPF agent 需要保证不同租户的数据隔离：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[eBPF Agent] --&gt; B[cgroup 过滤]&#10;    B --&gt; C{事件属于哪个租户?}&#10;    C --&gt; D[Tenant A Ring Buffer]&#10;    C --&gt; E[Tenant B Ring Buffer]&#10;    C --&gt; F[Tenant C Ring Buffer]&#10;    D --&gt; G[Tenant A 后端]&#10;    E --&gt; H[Tenant B 后端]&#10;    F --&gt; I[Tenant C 后端]\">flowchart TD\n    A[eBPF Agent] --&gt; B[cgroup 过滤]\n    B --&gt; C{事件属于哪个租户?}\n    C --&gt; D[Tenant A Ring Buffer]\n    C --&gt; E[Tenant B Ring Buffer]\n    C --&gt; F[Tenant C Ring Buffer]\n    D --&gt; G[Tenant A 后端]\n    E --&gt; H[Tenant B 后端]\n    F --&gt; I[Tenant C 后端]</pre><p>隔离维度：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>数据面隔离</strong>：通过 cgroup ID 或 namespace 在 eBPF 程序中过滤事件</li>\n<li><strong>控制面隔离</strong>：不同租户的策略 CRD 互不影响</li>\n<li><strong>资源隔离</strong>：每个租户的 map 使用独立的内存配额</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>部署模式</strong>：DaemonSet 是主流（资源与 Pod 数解耦、统一节点视角），Operator+CRD 适合声明式策略，嵌入应用镜像违背 eBPF 架构</li>\n<li><strong>最小权限</strong>：用 <code>CAP_BPF + CAP_PERFMON</code>（5.8+）并按需叠加 <code>NET_ADMIN</code>/<code>SYS_PTRACE</code>，避免 <code>privileged: true</code></li>\n<li><strong>内核兼容</strong>：集群内核异构，agent 需按版本探测能力并用 mermaid 决策树式的降级路径（完整模式 → CO-RE → 基础 kprobe → 跳过）</li>\n<li><strong>身份关联</strong>：cgroup ID 适合进程级、netns cookie 适合网络关联，K8s API watch 与 CRI 提供 metadata enrichment</li>\n<li><strong>优雅降级</strong>：启动时探测 BTF/ringbuf/fentry/LSM/timer，据此选择程序集与事件传输通道</li>\n<li><strong>升级安全</strong>：优先原子替换（<code>bpf_link_update</code>），Map 重要时用 pin + 替换，大版本升级用 cordon/drain</li>\n<li><strong>多租户隔离</strong>：数据面按 cgroup/namespace 过滤、控制面策略 CRD 隔离、资源面每租户独立 map 配额</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>相关文档</strong>：<a href=\"performance-overhead\">性能开销评估与优化</a> 量化 Kubernetes 部署的资源消耗；<a href=\"ebpf-ecosystem-future\">eBPF 生态与未来</a> 关注跨平台和新场景的演进方向。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"eBPF 在 Kubernetes 中的部署","id":"ebpf-在-kubernetes-中的部署"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"部署模型选择","id":"部署模型选择"},{"level":3,"text":"DaemonSet 配置要点","id":"daemonset-配置要点"},{"level":2,"text":"权限与安全","id":"权限与安全"},{"level":3,"text":"Linux Capabilities 最小集","id":"linux-capabilities-最小集"},{"level":3,"text":"Pod Security Standards 兼容性","id":"pod-security-standards-兼容性"},{"level":2,"text":"内核版本兼容性","id":"内核版本兼容性"},{"level":2,"text":"Pod 身份关联","id":"pod-身份关联"},{"level":3,"text":"cgroup ID 方案（推荐）","id":"cgroup-id-方案-推荐"},{"level":3,"text":"网络命名空间方案","id":"网络命名空间方案"},{"level":3,"text":"映射维护","id":"映射维护"},{"level":2,"text":"节点特性检测与优雅降级","id":"节点特性检测与优雅降级"},{"level":2,"text":"升级与滚动更新","id":"升级与滚动更新"},{"level":2,"text":"多租户隔离","id":"多租户隔离"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Cilium 与 Hubble 平台级可观测性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/ebpf-observability/toolchain/cilium-hubble"},"next":{"title":"性能开销评估与优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/ebpf-observability/production/performance-overhead"}}